WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.874
Gʋls-kãnga yel-bũn a yiibã fãa. A yaa bwaba kibar.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.330
Pĩnd wẽndẽ wã, sã n wa beẽ-kãnga, a ra pa tar makr baa a yen a nifẽ ye. A ra yaa ned sẽn tar pãng n yɩɩd zĩ-kãens fãa, la a ra miime.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.576
Zu-loees fãa, a ra basd-a lame t'a ges a nin-sõngo.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.136
Daar a ye koabgẽ, a yãame t'a kamelõonã kẽnga taoor ne a nao n paasdẽ.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.752
Rẽ yĩnga, zo-rũng sẽn yaa sũ-mar soaba, fo na n waa be tɩ saaga yaool n ta bɩ?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.146
A wẽnga a zug n zʋʋg a zugu. Zĩigã ne piiga sɩngame n yãgd-a.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.728
La kameleõ wã sĩndame, n toeem a yĩn-vẽenega, la a ka leok ye.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.900
Yaa zoees bala, gazelle. Sẽn kolg-a n ta be wã, t'a lebg a Termitɛɛr sẽn yaa miuugu.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.464
Wʋs-kãnga sẽn da loogd be wã sakame n na n yɩ bʋ-kaood.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:35.658
A sẽn wa n na n maan woto wã, a maana yɩɩl-yẽng n wilg sor ning b sẽn na n ta. Kẽerã fãa ra rat n yãame.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.768
Zĩig sã n wa vẽege, bu-zẽkrã ra pẽgda neb a taabã taoore.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:01.602
Wakat kãng fãa, kameleõ wã kolga ne sũ-noogo. A kẽnga a poorẽ n dɩk a sũ-paalgã sãnem.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.376
Ninsaalã zẽka a yɩɩnga, t'a sãnemd wa sobgã.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:28.396
A wẽneg n wẽnda a poorẽ: ned ka be ye. A sẽn na n tõog-a wã kɩtame t'a pa tar raood ye.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:38.354
A sẽn wa n be wã, a yũuda sũ-bʋgsem. A sẽn da be a poorẽ wã, kameleonã ra pa yikd ye.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.104
Rẽ poore, a yiime n sega a meng.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:01.496
A sẽn wa n be sorẽ wã, a sɩnga n na n maan yaal ne rotã sẽn pa tar pãng ye.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:10.866
Rẽ n so t'a kameleõ wã yi a poorẽ, n tɩ pɩʋʋg sorã. A ra tõoga!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.368
La log-tẽngã fãa ra yãgda.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.674
Gɛtã ka leb n gomd ye. Yaa rẽ n kɩt t'a yãbdẽ.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:47.232
A yãnde nintãm yii a nifẽ, n bas zĩn-dãmb a yiib sẽn ya wĩndgo.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.920
A sẽn wa n tãag-a wã, b pa le yik ye.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:14.946
Sẽn sɩng ne rũndã-rũndã, gazelã fãa tara zʋg-kãensã a yiibã. La kameleõ wã ket n kẽndame, la a pa yãgdẽ ye.
